{"ts": "2026-10-18T11:30:17+00:00", "event": "forecast", "slug": "2026-10-18-mc43327-belgium-france-italy-luxembourg-netherlands-germany-leave", "version": 1, "source": "metaculus", "post_id": 43327, "type": "binary", "median": 0.01, "iqr": [0.005, 0.02], "community": {"cp": null, "pro": null, "gold": null, "n_forecasters": null}, "thesis": "No founding member has ever triggered Article 50, no process is pending, and the window is about 10 weeks. Markets for any EU member leaving price a few percent. The forecast is most sensitive to a government announcing a binding exit vote or a formal notice, and none is visible.", "mode": "initial"}
